 "_about": "Little Classics, edited by Rossiter Johnson (Boston: James R. Osgood, later Houghton, Mifflin, 1874-1880), eighteen pocket volumes of the best short stories, sketches and poems in English. Seventeen of the eighteen from Internet Archive scans (many Google scans, rough OCR), raw; each matched to its volume by its title page and contents. Volume 16, Nature, has no scan online that could be found. Added 2026-10-23 at Adam's ask for old children's sets (a family set of its era, not a children's set strictly).",
